    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d697">

                <pb facs="1076" n="980" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg980"/>

                <head>No. 695.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Admiral Polo de Bernabé to Mr.
                    Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Spain</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 20,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, minister plenipotentiary of Spain, has the honor to inclose to
                    the honorable Hamilton Fish, Secretary of State of the United States, a literal
                    copy of a telegraphic dispatch from the minister of state at Madrid, with
                    express orders to communicate it to him.</p>
                <p>The undersigned avails, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOSÉ POLO DE BERNABÉ.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d697-a1.xml" xpointer="d697-a1"/>
            </div>
